  "description": "Self-owned resilience library for .NET. A composable execution pipeline carrying retry, timeout, circuit breaker, fallback and rate-limiter strategies, with outcome classification and a shared execution context. The circuit breaker itself has two trip triggers (failure ratio and consecutive failures), a sliding sample window, an injectable clock, state observation with manual control, and an invertible health-signal contract. The kernel takes no third-party resilience dependency.",
